  "title": "Eileen G Probable NDE 3202",
  "date": "'Jan 8,2006'",
  "content": "I was taken to Emergency Room with asthma attack I was having very bad pain in my chest. I told the doctor, that I felt like I was imploding. They got me onto the table. My heart rate was 180 and my o2 saturation was 80. I remember lying on the table; I could hear the people around me. I could hear my husband say, 'oh please don't die.' I closed my eyes and immediately felt warm and peaceful. I saw a white object in front of me. They were like vials they started to unfold and wrap around me. I felt safe. Then I thought of my grandson Mich'l. I was back on the table with all the life support equipment next to me. I'm convinced that it was my love for Mike that brought me back. I have told this story to several doctors and they all agree that it was an NDE.",
